WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:02.902 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Here´s what people are
talking about this morning.

00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:05.405 align:start size:94% position:6%
President Trump went on
a Twitter rant about fake news

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:08.308 size:88% position:44%
and threatened to revoke
NBC´s broadcast license.

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:10.343 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:12.379
Americans are like, "Hey,
you can threaten our democracy,

00:00:12.379 --> 00:00:14.114 align:start size:94% position:6%
but you do not mess with
"This Is Us."

00:00:14.114 --> 00:00:15.982 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean this..."

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:18.084 size:84% position:42%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:22.188 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then later in the day,
Trump said it´s disgusting

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:25.358
that the press is able to write
whatever it wants to write.

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:27.594 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:30.730 align:start size:94% position:6%
When asked about the first
amendment, he said,

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:33.833 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Is that the one that says not
to talk about fight club?

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:36.036
Because I know that one.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:39.472
I also know the second one."

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:40.507 align:start size:94% position:6%
And everybody´s
talking about this.

00:00:40.507 --> 00:00:42.108
Last night at the B.E.T. awards,

00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:46.413
Eminem did a four-minute
freestyle rap criticizing Trump.

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:47.647 align:start size:94% position:6%
Of course, the president
isn´t just going

00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:48.715
to ignore something like that.

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:50.817
So today, Trump clapped back

00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:53.019
with a freestyle rap of his own.

00:00:53.019 --> 00:00:54.988 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.988 --> 00:00:56.689 align:start size:94% position:6%
It´s a clapback.
Check this out.

00:00:56.689 --> 00:00:57.857 align:start size:94% position:6%
-♫ Boom, boom ♫

00:00:57.857 --> 00:00:59.059
♫ Boom, boom, knock, knock ♫

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:00.293 align:start size:94% position:6%
♫ Aaah, wah ♫

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:01.461 size:88% position:44%
♫ Bum, bum, bum, China ♫

00:01:01.461 --> 00:01:02.595 size:78% position:39%
♫ B-b-b-b-bing that ♫

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:03.696 align:start size:94% position:6%
♫ Bomb, bomb, aah ♫

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:05.265
♫ Bing, bing, bum, bum, bum ♫

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:06.533 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hello!

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:08.268 size:84% position:42%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:08.268 --> 00:01:10.236 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hello!
-Hello!

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:11.738 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hello!

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:13.740 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Applause ]

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:15.742 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, Trump was mad.
-Was he really?

00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:17.410 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Trump was mad, but he
was also a little confused.

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:19.312
Today he told people to boycott
the M&amp;M store.

00:01:19.312 --> 00:01:21.414 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Are you serious?
-And you go, "No. That´s..."

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:24.050
-"Reese´s pieces are the best.

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:26.386 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.386 --> 00:01:29.722 align:start size:94% position:6%
They should have
their own store."

00:01:29.722 --> 00:01:32.058
Meanwhile, attorney general
Jeff Sessions has been trying

00:01:32.058 --> 00:01:34.561 align:start size:94% position:6%
to crack down on marijuana use
across the country,

00:01:34.561 --> 00:01:37.030
and Obama´s former attorney
general said it´s basically

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:38.898 size:78% position:39%
an obsession for him.

00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:40.500 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, check out what Sessions
had to say about it.

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:43.336
He said, "My position is that
marijuana should not be legal

00:01:43.336 --> 00:01:45.405 align:start size:94% position:6%
anywhere in the United States
of America.

00:01:45.405 --> 00:01:48.108 align:start size:94% position:6%
Blaa."
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:49.909 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, my God.

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:52.312 align:start size:94% position:6%
Wow.
-What?

00:01:52.312 --> 00:01:53.646 align:start size:94% position:6%
Wow.

00:01:53.646 --> 00:01:56.349 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Guys, I read that Kim Jong-un
wants to make the site

00:01:56.349 --> 00:01:58.852 size:84% position:42%
of his missile launches
a tourist destination

00:01:58.852 --> 00:02:01.955 align:start size:94% position:6%
for families.

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:03.857
But for kids to go on the rides,
they must be taller

00:02:03.857 --> 00:02:04.924 align:start size:94% position:6%
than Kim Jong-un.
-Really?

00:02:04.924 --> 00:02:06.559 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, they have to.
[ Applause ]

00:02:06.559 --> 00:02:08.661 align:start size:94% position:6%
It´s the only thing
they´re asking.

00:02:11.231 --> 00:02:12.332 size:81% position:41%
Big sports story here.

00:02:12.332 --> 00:02:13.633 size:81% position:41%
U.S. men´s soccer team

00:02:13.633 --> 00:02:16.836 align:start size:94% position:6%
failed to qualify
for the World Cup

00:02:16.836 --> 00:02:19.806 size:88% position:44%
after losing to Trinidad
and Tobago last night.

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:22.008
In response, Trump was like,
"Why did America have to play

00:02:22.008 --> 00:02:24.911
two countries at the same time?
Rigged.

00:02:24.911 --> 00:02:28.114
That´s tough. Believe me."

00:02:28.114 --> 00:02:29.249 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Applause ]

00:02:29.249 --> 00:02:30.683 align:start size:94% position:6%
Check this out.
Amazon just announced

00:02:30.683 --> 00:02:33.453 align:start size:94% position:6%
that teens can now shop
on their parents´ accounts,

00:02:33.453 --> 00:02:35.088 align:start size:94% position:6%
but the order
will only go through

00:02:35.088 --> 00:02:38.458
if mom and dad approve it
or if they click the button

00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:39.959 align:start size:94% position:6%
that says,
mom and dad approve it.

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:41.361 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.361 --> 00:02:43.296 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Click.
-I´ll wait for dad to see

00:02:43.296 --> 00:02:46.032
if he can click this button.

00:02:46.032 --> 00:02:48.501
Amazon´s also working
with a company to deliver items

00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:50.503
to the trunk of your car.

00:02:50.503 --> 00:02:52.038 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:52.038 --> 00:02:54.240 align:start size:94% position:6%
The company has a very
interesting name -- The Mafia.

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:56.543 align:start size:94% position:6%
Very interesting, yeah.
We have a great show tonight.

00:02:56.543 --> 00:02:57.911 align:start size:94% position:6%
Give it up for The Roots,
ladies and gentlemen.

